                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <customfield id="customfield_10954" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Test Step</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;1. Send the following B-CAN signal to ICB,&lt;br/&gt;
Transmitter: BCM&lt;br/&gt;
Receivers: NAVI&lt;br/&gt;
Frame Name: MICU_BCM&lt;br/&gt;
CAN ID: 12F81018&lt;br/&gt;
Signal Name: C_BACKLTSW&lt;br/&gt;
Cycle Time: 300&lt;br/&gt;
DLC: 8&lt;br/&gt;
Layout: 3.7-3.7&lt;br/&gt;
Value: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Contents: Backlight SW&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
2. Send the following B-CAN signal to the ICB after confirming the rear&lt;br/&gt;
camera screen is displayed&lt;br/&gt;
Transmitter: BIM&lt;br/&gt;
Receivers: NAVI&lt;br/&gt;
Frame Name: BSI_CTM_STATUS&lt;br/&gt;
CAN ID: EF8C59F&lt;br/&gt;
Signal Name: C_BSI_CTM_BUZZER_STATUS&lt;br/&gt;
Cycle Time: 300&lt;br/&gt;
DLC: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Layout: 0.7-0.7&lt;br/&gt;
Value: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Contents: CTM Buzzer ON&lt;br/&gt;
Transmitter: BIM&lt;br/&gt;
Receivers: NAVI&lt;br/&gt;
Frame Name: BSI_CTM_STATUS&lt;br/&gt;
CAN ID: EF8C59F&lt;br/&gt;
Signal Name: C_BSI_CTM_SYSTEM_STATUS&lt;br/&gt;
Cycle Time: 300&lt;br/&gt;
DLC: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Layout: 0.6-0.6&lt;br/&gt;
Value: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Contents: CTM ON&lt;br/&gt;
Transmitter: BIM&lt;br/&gt;
Receivers: NAVI&lt;br/&gt;
Frame Name: BSI_CTM_STATUS&lt;br/&gt;
CAN ID: EF8C59F&lt;br/&gt;
Signal Name: C_BSI_CTM_SYSTEM_FAIL&lt;br/&gt;
Cycle Time: 300&lt;br/&gt;
DLC: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Layout: 0.5-0.5&lt;br/&gt;
Value: 0&lt;br/&gt;
Contents: CTM normal&lt;br/&gt;
Transmitter: BIM&lt;br/&gt;
Receivers: NAVI&lt;br/&gt;
Frame Name: BSI_CTM_STATUS&lt;br/&gt;
CAN ID: EF8C59F&lt;br/&gt;
